.envrc
texlive/
tds/
# Generated doc artifacts (make doc; pandoc + lualatex from README*.md)
jlreq.pdf
jlreq-ja.pdf
jlreq.html
jlreq-ja.html
jlreq-trimmarks.html
jlreq-trimmarks-ja.html

# pTeX/upTeX/LuaTeX JFM build artifacts (make jfm; regenerable from
